:1 (2x RTX PRO 6000 96GB)\" with total ~30 GPU-hours used, status \"All experiments complete. GPUs idle.\"\n\n### 3. **schema_semantic_constrained_ie - Supplementary Plan**\n**File path:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/llama_docred_maxtoken/experiment_plan.md`\n\nThis markdown file documents a follow-up truncation hypothesis test for Llama DocRED max_tokens parameter increase (4096 → 6144 tokens). It includes:\n- Background and hypothesis about parse failures\n- Current and new parameter values\n- Detailed parallel execution commands for 2 experiment groups\n- Server status verification (2026-05-15)\n- Runtime estimation (6-7 hours total)\n- Validation criteria with decision logic for hypothesis testing\n- Expected outcome metrics for parse_failures and E-F1\n\n**Additional findings:**\n- **Lock file:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/experiment_plan.lock` exists but is empty\n- **91 files contain \"planned\"** in the codebase (mostly in logs and session data)\n- Status fields are primarily tracked in experiment YAML files under `status` field (supported/completed/planned variants) or `result` field with outcome descriptions"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1cacedeb-b163-4c32-a49e-d1d0cc8c9352","uuid":"afbd8ff4-7a7c-4b00-8fa9-4d0d92eb19b3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:23:10.613Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Search in /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6 for files named \"experiment_plan\" or containing \"planned\" experiment entries. Look for YAML, JSON, or markdown files that define an experiment plan with status fields. Check files like experiment_plan.yaml, experiment_plan.md, experiments/*.yaml, etc. Report the file path and its full contents. Search breadth: medium.","agentId":"a3d1cbf95ce7c3cbd","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have found the experiment plan f